<title>USA: Drexler receives 50,000-card order.</title>
<headline>Drexler receives 50,000-card order.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drexler Technology Corp said Wednesday a Philippine government agency has order 50,000 of its LaserCard opticalmemory cards.</p>
<p>Financial terms were undisclosed, but the cards are scheduled to ship over the next 60 days.</p>
<p>The laser recordable, data-storage cards will be issued to Filipino citizens for use as duty-free shopping cards.</p>
<p>The Drexler card has been issued to about 130,000 Filipinos over the past nine months for use at a special economic zone, replacing paper records for admission to the zone's duty-free superstores and for tracking purchase limits.</p>
</text>
